<title>POLAND: Bytom plans no 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>Bytom plans no 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Bytom SA plans no 1996 payout and wants to earmark all 1996 net profit of about 300,000 zlotys for reserve capital, the company's president said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The profit is so small that...all of it will be earmarked for reserve capital,&quot; Wlodzimierz Szydlo told Reuters.</p>
<p>Last year Bytom paid one-zloty dividend per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
